WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.530
How do you turn a story into maths?

00:00:02.530 --> 00:00:04.620
5 birds sit on a wire.

00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:06.200
3 fly away.

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:08.010
Taking away means minus.

00:00:08.010 --> 00:00:10.650
5 − 3 = 2.

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:14.016
The story becomes one short number sentence.
